{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower Defense with a Nonsense twist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your crystal your way. Lean on your trusty <strong>PAL</strong>, hire <strong>soldiers and archers</strong>, drop <strong>towers</strong>, or call in <strong>heroes and their sidekicks</strong>. <strong>Grab and move</strong> everything mid battle. Pop abilities to thin the horde, <strong>dash and dodge roll</strong> through skill shots, and keep the waves at bay alongside your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/6388743c0896f87f5a4e9441f4948a3d.poster.avif?t=1764679848\" width=434 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/6388743c0896f87f5a4e9441f4948a3d.webm?t=1764679848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/6388743c0896f87f5a4e9441f4948a3d.mp4?t=1764679848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Move, Upgrade</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time action:</strong> Kite enemies, time your abilities, and stay on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades that matters:</strong> Upgrade stats, dodge chance, damage reflection, heroes and sidekicks\u2014and kit out your PAL with multi-shot, damage auras, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your style:</strong> Rely on your PAL, field a small army, or go tower-heavy. It all works and it\u2019s all moveable.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/640c64471e9b0789b56cb704c46046fa.poster.avif?t=1764679848\" width=434 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/640c64471e9b0789b56cb704c46046fa.webm?t=1764679848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/640c64471e9b0789b56cb704c46046fa.mp4?t=1764679848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team choices:</strong> Pick your own PAL path while agreeing on\u00a0<strong>shared team upgrades</strong> with the squad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villagers can do the grunt work:</strong> Hire them to gather resources while you focus on the fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/0d8efa60dbdec717b783582e23c9e846.poster.avif?t=1764679848\" width=434 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/0d8efa60dbdec717b783582e23c9e846.webm?t=1764679848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/0d8efa60dbdec717b783582e23c9e846.mp4?t=1764679848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 Player Co-Op?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absolutely! Defend until the end with your friends.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449420/extras/d27a7d77f2596aff9c493c822374f02d.avif?t=1764679848\" width=1445 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duo Developed. Made with Unreal Engine 5.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/344942